OL,3,CMan, 75, dead and four others suffer
OL,4,Csmoke inhalation after fire
OL,6,FA 75-year old man has died and four
OL,7,Fother people have suffered smoke
OL,8,Finhalation after a fire in a property
OL,9,Fin Staffordshire.
OL,11,FIt happened at a property on Ridgway
OL,12,FRoad in Shelton in Stoke-on-Trent, at
OL,13,Faround 12:50pm today (8 August).
OL,15,FStaffordshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,16,Fcrews extinguished the fire, and the
OL,17,Fbuilding was evacuated.
OL,19,FThe 75-year old man was found dead at
OL,20,Fthe scene.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
