OL,3,CMan, 75, dead and four others suffer
OL,4,Csmoke inhalation after fire
OL,6,FFour other people were treated for
OL,7,Fsmoke inhalation - one woman in her
OL,8,F60s was taken to hospital.
OL,10,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,11,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,12,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,13,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,15,FThe deceased man's next of kin have
OL,16,Fbeen informed and police say the
OL,17,Ffamily is being supported by specially-
OL,18,Ftrained officers.
