OL,3,CMan, 75, dead and four others suffer
OL,4,Csmoke inhalation after fire
OL,6,FStaffordshire Police is working with
OL,7,Ffire crew colleagues to investigate
OL,8,Fhow the blaze began.
OL,10,FThey are appealing for witnesses.
